  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3403473736662564908}
  m_Text: 'Station air:

    SULFUR-RICH

    (process gases nearby).


    Sulfur
    can attack the silver

    in standard terminations.

    Anti-sulfur types are
    built

    to resist it. Look for the

    green dot on the body.'
